lantern-pr 1
# 19
#title feat: richer pull request details in the hover card and sidebar
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/19
#branch feat/pr-details
#base main
#opened 2026-11-09
#head 7712584ad936a06bd589ca8c6efeb4053dbb95fa
#summary Author, dates, comments and reviewer verdicts in the PR hover card and sidebar, and a PR-like header for local comparisons
#describe what The PR hover card and the sidebar header show the author with avatar, when the PR was opened and last updated, comment counts, a draft badge and the reviewers with their approvals or change requests
#describe what Details come from Bitbucket or GitHub when an account is added, otherwise the author and last update come from the branch's commits
#describe what A local comparison uses the same header as a remote PR, with a local badge and a Context section for missing reasons and unmapped files
#describe before The hover card showed only the title, state and branch, and a local comparison had its own plain layout
#describe after The card and header show who opened the PR, when, and where review stands; errors from writing reasons go to the problems log
#describe verified Typecheck, lint and the test suite pass except the known licences and pr-explain-service failures
#describe verified New tests cover the Bitbucket and GitHub detail parsing, avatar inlining, the info overlay and the card rendering
